# IMP-60 golden gateway route inventory (healthHandler + gw.routes, DB deployment shape).
# Format: <METHOD> <pattern> <chain>; chain classes: public|auth|labels|credit|failover|anthropic-envelope.
# Regenerate ONLY with: ROUTES_GOLDEN_UPDATE=1 go test ./pkg/cli/ -run TestGatewayRoutesGolden
